#~ "it if you have the ability and wish to do so.</li><li>If you distribute a "
#~ "modified version, it must again be released under the same license so "
#~ "that everyone benefits.</li></ul><p>It is published in the hope that it "
#~ "will be useful, but <i>without any warranty</i>. The complete license "
#~ "text is available on your computer at <i>/usr/share/common-licenses/"
#~ "GPL-3</i>.</p><h3>A final word</h3><div class='merke'><b>☕ I would be "
